<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<title>{{title}} Berhasil</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Montserrat, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ecedf0; margin: 0; padding: 20px; color: #4b4b4b;">
	<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px;">
		<p style="text-align: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #17283c; margin: 0 0 16px;">{{school}}</p>
		<h1 style="font-size: 22px; color: #17283c; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 24px;">{{title}} Berhasil</h1>
		<p style="margin: 0;">Halo {{recipient}},</p>
		<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Berikut kami informasikan detail akun beserta pembayarannya:</p>
		<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #f7f7f7; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
			<tr><td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Total pembayaran</td><td style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: right;">{{totalAmount}}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Payment method</td><td style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: right;">{{paymentMethod}}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="padding: 8px 12px;">{{onBehalfLabel}}</td><td style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: right;">{{onBehalfOf}}</td></tr>
		</table>
		<p style="font-weight: 600; color: #17283c; margin: 0 0 8px;">Detail Transaksi</p>
		<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #f7f7f7; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
			<tr><td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Transaksi ID</td><td style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: right;">{{code}}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Nama transaksi</td><td style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: right;">{{transactionName}}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="padding: 8px 12px;">Tanggal transaksi</td><td style="padding: 8px 12px; text-align: right;">{{date}}</td></tr>
		</table>
		<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777777; text-align: center;">Jika ada pertanyaan terkait transaksi ini, silakan langsung<br> menghubungi bagian pembayaran Pondok ROJA.</p>
		<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #abb4be; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; padding-top: 16px; margin-top: 24px;">&copy; {{year}} {{school}}. All Rights Reserved.</p>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
